{"id":"743a0376168bb7ec","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-padding.md","title":"Padding 引理","display":"lem-padding — Padding 引理","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-padding","aliases":["20-lem-padding"],"display":"lem-padding — Padding 引理","chapter":"1","section":"1.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Lemma 1.5.2","source_pdf_pages":[46],"source_printed_pages":[10],"depends_on":["[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-padding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-padding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-padding — Padding 引理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Lemma 1.5.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>46</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>10</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,t\\in\\omega\">\\(e,t\\in\\omega\\)</span>；标准编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}padding}\\vdash\n\\exists p\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\bigl[(\\forall e,t\\ \\varphi_{p(e,t)}=\\varphi_e)\\land\n(\\forall e,j,t,u\\ [p(e,t)=p(j,u)\\Rightarrow e=j\\land t=u])\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}padding}\\vdash\n\\exists p\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\bigl[(\\forall e,t\\ \\varphi_{p(e,t)}=\\varphi_e)\\land\n(\\forall e,j,t,u\\ [p(e,t)=p(j,u)\\Rightarrow e=j\\land t=u])\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>复制原程序，并增添由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 编码的不可达状态与指令；程序代码有效构造且互异。无需断言不同函数索引必有不同函数值。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 1.5.2；印刷页 10；PDF 第 46 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e,t\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}padding}\\vdash\n\\exists p\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\bigl[(\\forall e,t\\ \\varphi_{p(e,t)}=\\varphi_e)\\land\n(\\forall e,j,t,u\\ [p(e,t)=p(j,u)\\Rightarrow e=j\\land t=u])\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"t","display":false}],"bytes":1239,"backlinks":[{"id":"d9aaf109dea18156","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-movable-markers]]；see [[20-thm-sigma3-representation]]；see [[20-df-ext]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]。"},{"id":"4c42b7b0a71a7e77","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-index-set]]；see [[20-df-cylinder]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]。"},{"id":"57024db84a89e3e6","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-index-set]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-cor-self-singleton]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]。"},{"id":"eedfed81ed59c040","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-complete-ce-index]]；see [[20-df-cof]]；see [[20-df-rec-index]]；see [[20-df-movable-markers]]；see [[20-thm-inf-complexity]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]；see [[20-th